,v,w\\} & =\\{x,y,z\\}\\cup \\{u,v,w\\} \\\\  & =\\{u,v,w,x,y,z\\}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534561 17592186045417 true] [17592186425787 1068 #edb/ref 17592186425783 13194139534561 17592186045417 true] [17592186425787 1069 "q-174409" 13194139534561 17592186045417 true] [17592186425787 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534561 17592186045417 true] [17592186425787 1071 "Find the disjoint union of the sets $\\{△,◻\\}$ and $\\{a,c,e\\}.$" 13194139534561 17592186045417 true] [17592186425787 1072 #uuid "813ddd4d-da5d-5704-86ca-2482c62cc8ff" 13194139534561 17592186045417 true] [17592186425787 1074 "Notice that the sets are disjoint since\n\n$$\n\\{△,◻\\}\\cap \\{a,c,e\\}=∅.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the disjoint union is simply the union:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\{△,◻\\}⊔\\{a,c,e\\} & =\\{△,◻\\}\\cup \\{a,c,e\\} \\\\  & =\\{△,◻,a,c,e\\}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534561 17592186045417 true] [17592186425788 1068 #edb/ref 17592186425781 13194139534561 17592186045417 true] [17592186425788 1069 "q-174426" 13194139534561 17592186045417 true] [17592186425788 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534561 17592186045417 true] [17592186425788 1071 "Find the disjoint union of the sets ${A}_{1}=\\{1,3,5\\}$ and ${A}_{2}=\\{5,10,15\\}.$" 13194139534561 17592186045417 true] [17592186425788 1072 #uuid "89ecc974-5ce9-51bb-a7b1-6a66513489d0" 13194139534561 17592186045417 true] [17592186425788 1074 "Notice that the sets are overlapping since\n\n$$\n\\{1,3,5\\}\\cap \\{5,10,15\\}=\\{5\\}\\ne ∅.\n$$\n\nSo, for each of our sets, we form the associated set, where each element is tagged with the corresponding index, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {A}_{1} &  & \\,\\to \\, &  & {A}_{1}^{∗}=\\{(1,1),(3,1),(5,1)\\} \\\\  & {A}_{2} &  & \\,\\to \\, &  & {A}_{2}^{∗}=\\{(5,2),(10,2),(15,2)\\}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the disjoint union of our sets is simply the union of the associated tagged sets:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}_{1}⊔{A}_{2} & =\\{1,3,5\\}⊔\\{5,10,15\\} \\\\  & ={A}_{1}^{∗}\\cup {A}_{2}^{∗